OL,3,GNEWSAPolice name two men who died in
OL,4,Aworkplace incident near rural road
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who died after a workplace
OL,7,Fincident at a road in County Down on
OL,8,FFriday have been named by police.
OL,10,FJoseph Hobbs, 23, from Comber and Mark
OL,11,FGlover, 38, from Ballygowan received
OL,12,Fmedical treatment but were pronounced
OL,13,Fdead at the scene.
OL,15,FThe incident happened on the Ballygowan
OL,16,FRoad in Crossnacreevy at about 10:45
OL,17,FBST on Friday.
OL,19,FPolice said their sympathies remained
OL,20,F"with all those affected by this tragic
OL,21,Fincident".
